// Gamma-Poisson conjugate update for on-device event-rate estimation.
// Posterior: Gamma(α, β) over the Poisson rate λ.
// Update on observing k events in one tick: (α, β) → (α + k, β + 1).
//
// Used here as a stress test on the architecture: no nalgebra, no AD,
// no Riccati. If the pipeline still works for this, the parts that
// "still work" are genuinely architecture rather than Kalman scaffolding.
GammaPoisson(GammaPoissonSpec(
    prior_shape: 1.0,
    prior_rate: 1.0,
    tick_interval: Timestep(0.1),
))
